  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In roasting process, metal sulphide&nbsp;ore are converted into metal oxide and sulphur is remove in the form of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> gas.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>MS</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mover><mn>2</mn><mi>MO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8593;</mo></math></p>"
  }
